{"id":"wb-8-229","name":"汾阳关帝庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汾阳关帝庙","text":"汾阳关帝庙，位于山西省吕梁市汾阳市鼓楼南街东侧，是中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n1996年1月12日公布为山西省文物保护单位。2019年10月7日公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%BE%E9%98%B3%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%9D%E5%BA%99","revisionId":85848368,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85848368","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/007ae62f654cb2040c82d9ba.jpg","title":"汾阳关帝庙.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B1%BE%E9%98%B3%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%9D%E5%BA%99.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/%E6%B1%BE%E9%98%B3%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%9D%E5%BA%99.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Fymking","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNSX-358-013","width":320,"height":214}}